{
 "unit_id": "CD7304-kabongo-1",
 "as_of": "2026-10-01",
 "summary": "Kabongo territory (Haut-Lomami) has no reported armed-group control or significant armed-group activity in 2025-2026; the Mai-Mai/Bakata Katanga resurgence in northern ex-Katanga in 2026 was concentrated in neighbouring Bukama, Malemba-Nkulu and Mitwaba. Historic Mai-Mai violence in Kabongo (Gédéon / 'Shinja Shinja' factions, mid-2000s) has long ended. ACP described Haut-Lomami as calm across the province in September 2026. Kabongo town (territory seat) and the rural secteurs Kabongo and Kayamba (Kabongo, Kitenge, Kayamba and Songa health zones) are assessed as default state presence under the PNC, with lower confidence for the eastern Kitenge health zone nearer Malemba-Nkulu.",
